   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">- Rapid assessment of statistical gaps for key development finance flows;
- Household survey on the impact of the crisis on households&#x2019; well-being on a regular basis, closing statistical gaps;
- Analysis on the impact of the Ukrainian crisis (rising prices, falling exports and FDI, restrictions on imports, falling incomes of migrants, etc.) on development finance flows and vulnerable groups;
- Developed Risk Matrix and recommendations.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2022">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. No data, analysis and capacity for policy making and programming in respect of impact of the Ukrainian crisis on the key development finance flows and the vulnerable groups. 
2. Government institutions lack capacity and weak understanding on impact of the secondary sanctions.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
